=== prodigal, prokka, bakta, barrnap
--- prodigal -
-a 	write protein translations to the selected file
-c 	closed ends: don't let genes run off the edges
-d 	write nucleotide sequences of genes to the selected file
-f 	select output format (gbk, gff, or sco)
-g 	specify a translation table to use
-h 	print help menu and exit
-i 	specify FASTA/Genbank input file
-m 	treat runs of N as masked sequence; don't build genes across them
-n 	bypass Shine-Dalgarno trainer and force a full motif scan
-o 	specify output file
-p 	select procedure (single or meta)
-q 	run quietly (suppress normal stderr output)
-s 	write all potential genes (with scores) to the selected file
-t 	write a training file, or read it if it exists
-v 	print version number and exit
--- prodigal -p 
meta 
single 
--- prodigal -i data/
data/contigs.fa 
data/sub/
--- prokka --kingdom 
Archaea 
Bacteria 
Mitochondria 
Viruses 
--- prokka --hmms data/
data/models.hmm 
data/sub/
--- prokka data/
data/contigs.fa 
data/sub/
--- bakta --gram 
+ 
- 
\? 
--- bakta --skip-
--skip-cds 	skip CDS detection & annotation
--skip-crispr 	skip CRISPR array detection & annotation
--skip-filter 	skip feature overlap filters
--skip-gap 	skip gap detection & annotation
--skip-ncrna 	skip ncRNA detection & annotation
--skip-ncrna-region 	skip ncRNA region detection & annotation
--skip-ori 	skip oriC/oriT detection & annotation
--skip-plot 	skip generation of circular genome plots
--skip-pseudo 	skip pseudogene detection & annotation
--skip-rrna 	skip rRNA detection & annotation
--skip-sorf 	skip sORF detection & annotation
--skip-tmrna 	skip tmRNA detection & annotation
--skip-trna 	skip tRNA detection & annotation
--- bakta data/
data/contigs.fa 
data/sub/
--- barrnap --kingdom 
arc 
bac 
fun 
--- barrnap --no-
--no-mrna 	don't find mRNA
--no-ncrna 	don't find ncRNA
--no-rrna 	don't find rRNA
--no-trna 	don't find tRNA
--- barrnap data/
data/contigs.fa 
data/ont.fastq 
data/r1.fq.gz 
data/r2.fq.gz 
data/sub/
